<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Artigos LIGEM</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #08111f, #0f172a 48%, #101827); color: #e2e8f0; min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; text-decoration: none; }
    .topbar-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .pill { padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18); border-radius: 999px; color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #0ea5e9); color: white; }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    .btn-logout { background: transparent; color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); font-family: inherit; }
    .main-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .hero p { color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; }
    .card { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.14); border-radius: 18px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(2,6,23,0.35); }
    .alert { padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .alert-error { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); color: #fca5a5; }
    .alert-success { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.2); color: #86efac; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .form-group label { display: block; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .form-group input, .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(2,6,23,0.35); color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus { outline: none; border-color: #60a5fa; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,0.16); }
    .actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .note { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .actions { flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: stretch; }
      .topbar-inner { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .topbar { height: auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Artigos LIGEM</a>
      <div class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/author" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:0.55rem 0.85rem;">Área do Participante</a>
        <% if (isReviewer) { %>
          <a href="/reviewer" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:0.55rem 0.85rem;">Painel do Revisor</a>
        <% } %>
        <% if (isAdmin) { %>
          <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:0.55rem 0.85rem;">Dashboard Admin</a>
        <% } %>
        <span class="pill"><%= userEmail %></span>
        <form method="POST" action="/login/logout" style="display:inline;">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout" style="padding:0.55rem 0.85rem;">Sair</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Meus Dados</h1>
      <p>Atualize aqui suas informações cadastrais para manter suas inscrições e submissões vinculadas corretamente à sua conta.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="note">
        Alterações de nome, e-mail e instituição passam a valer imediatamente para o seu cadastro de acesso. Se necessário, você ainda poderá complementar dados de inscrição específicos em cada evento.
      </div>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (success) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-success"><%= success %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/author/profile">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Nome completo *</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required value="<%= formData.name || '' %>">
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">E-mail *</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required value="<%= formData.email || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="institution">Instituição</label>
            <input type="text" id="institution" name="institution" value="<%= formData.institution || '' %>">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="cpf">CPF</label>
            <input type="text" id="cpf" name="cpf" value="<%= formData.cpf || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="passport">Passaporte</label>
            <input type="text" id="passport" name="passport" value="<%= formData.passport || '' %>">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="country">País</label>
          <%- include('../partials/country-select', { selectedCountry: formData.country || '', selectId: 'country', selectName: 'country' }) %>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a href="/author" class="btn btn-secondary">Voltar</a>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Salvar Alterações</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>&copy; <%= year %> LIGEM.Redes • <%= typeof appVersion !== 'undefined' ? appVersion : 'V0.1' %></footer>
</body>
</html>
